<|SECTION:DECISION FINDINGS|>
Address every finding below in one complete revision of the original text. These findings identify supplied passages; their probabilities express uncertainty, not severity or similarity.
Follow each finding's instructions. For a repeated-beat finding, {% if repetition_handling == "rewrite" %}replace the repeated beat with genuinely different content, dropping it if no meaningful rewrite is possible{% else %}remove the repeated beat{% endif %}. For a description-reuse finding, replace the reused description while preserving the event, unless a repeated-beat finding also identifies that event as redundant. For style, follow the finding's instructions while preserving factual content.
{% for finding in decision_findings %}
- F{{ loop.index }} ({{ finding.passage_id }} / {{ finding.kind }}): {{ finding.text }}
  Instructions: {{ finding.instructions }}
{% endfor %}
